exchange native-apdu 90AA0000010100 => D60DC81274C93554EC042168056A8B8C91AF
exchange native-apdu 90AF00002025471A4562837B98E5837661044D43D9DD2517ECF1352D71CCE2AECD954C4A8600 => F49CCCCEE310B05BB6B9FB85148408EB9100
